OL,3,GNEWSAMP's concern over alleged arrest
OL,4,Aof councillor
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour MP Melanie Onn has written to
OL,7,Fthe chairman of Reform UK raising
OL,8,Fconcerns over the alleged arrest of one
OL,9,Fof its local councillors in North East
OL,10,FLincolnshire.
OL,12,FIn her letter to Lee Anderson, which
OL,13,Fshe posted on Facebook, Melanie Onn
OL,14,Fsaid she understands that councillor
OL,15,FJames Sawkins "is subject to an ongoing
OL,16,Fpolice investigation and that criminal
OL,17,Fproceedings have been listed before the
OL,18,Fmagistrates' court".
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
