OL,3,GNEWSAMP's concern over alleged arrest
OL,4,Aof councillor
OL,5,
OL,6,FOnn asks if Reform UK were aware of the
OL,7,Farrest and whether the party has
OL,8,F"considered appropriate interim
OL,9,Fmeasures in relation to his party and
OL,10,Fcouncil responsibilities".
OL,12,FA Reform UK spokesperson said Sawkins
OL,13,Fhad not been charged and "understand
OL,14,Fthe allegations concern a third party".
